    "function_v0": {
      "doc": "Creates an all-or-nothing remittance escrow.\\n\\n`intended_provider` is the only address that may accept and receive the\\nprotected asset. `recipient` is the beneficiary of the local delivery\\nand must confirm receipt on-chain before the seller can release funds.\\nThe remittance metadata is stored separately from `Escrow` so escrows\\ncreated by older contract versions keep their original behavior.",
